      48.0,
      446.87,
      542.52,
      532.01
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me by section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. Harini Amarasuriya, the Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respect of the \u201cSri Lanka Institute of Tourism and Hotel Management\u201d, established by the Tourism Act, No. 38 of 2005, and located at No. 78, Galle Road, Colombo 03 do by this Order subject to such conditions as specified in Schedule I hereto, recognize the \u201cSri Lanka Institute of Tourism and Hotel Management\u201d as a Degree Awarding Institute for the purpose of developing Higher Education therein, leading to the award of the Degree specified in Column I of the Schedule II hereto, of which the abbreviation is set out in the corresponding entry in Column II of the Schedule II hereto:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
