      48.0,
      588.87,
      542.53,
      626.01
    ],
    "text": "1. Sri Lanka Institute of Tourism and Hotel Management (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cinstitute\u201d) shall, when admitting students for the degree programme specified in Schedule II hereto in respect of the Bachelor of Hotel and Resort Management Honours with a minimum of 120 Credits (SLQF Level 6), adhere to the minimum entry qualification of;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
